ather leaves the house","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":7,"title":"A girl playing rough with dolls and soft toys","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":8,"title":"A girl pointing at a rock","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":9,"title":"A girl imagining a scary figure in different everyday objects","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":10,"title":"A girl and her brother standing under a dense foliage","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":11,"title":"A grandmother putting a girl to sleep","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":12,"title":"A girl awake in the middle of the night","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":13,"title":"A ghost-like figure hanging mid-air","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":14,"title":"A boy under a bedsheet pretending to be a ghost","illustrator":"Gitanjali Iyer","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯ ಬಾ ಇಲ್ಲಿ. ಈ ಹುಡುಗಿ ಊಟ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ,” ಅಮ್ಮ ಹೇಳಿದಳು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಹಟ ಮಾಡುವ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯನಿಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟವಂತೆ!”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಜ್ಜ. ನಾನೂ ವಾಕಿಂಗ್‌ ಬರ್ತೀನಿ.”","“ಸರಿ ಪುಟ್ಟಿ. ನಾನು ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯನ ಜೊತೆ ವಾಕಿಂಗ್‌ ಹೋಗ್ತೀನಿ. ಬರ್ತೀಯಾ?”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಪುಟ್ಟಿ ವಾಕಿಂಗ್‌ ಹೋಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಜೋರಾಗಿ ಎಳೀಬೇಡ, ಪುಟ್ಟಿ. ಕಿತ್ತು ಹೋಗುತ್ತೆ,” ಎಂದರು ವೀಣತ್ತೆ.","“ಗೊಂಬೆ ಹಾಳು ಮಾಡುವವರು ಅಂದರೆ ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯನಿಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯ ಹೀಗೆ ಇರಬಹುದಾ ಅಣ್ಣಾ?”","“ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ ಪುಟ್ಟಿ.”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯ ಹೀಗೆ ಇರಬಹುದಾ ಅಣ್ಣಾ?”","“ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ ಪುಟ್ಟಿ.”","“ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯ ಹೀಗೆ ಇರಬಹುದಾ ಅಣ್ಣಾ?”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ ಪುಟ್ಟಿ.”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಎಲ್ಲ ಸುಖವಾಗಿದ್ದರು.”","“ನಿದ್ರೆ ಮಾಡದ ಪುಟ್ಟ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಅಂದರೆ ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯನಿಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟ.”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಣ್ಣಾ, ಅಣ್ಣಾ, ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯ ಬಂದಾ…”"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಗೊಗ್ಗಯ್ಯ!”"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/640996-goggayya-elli/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":75}